CMake target name: XcbQpaPrivate_Attribution_xcb-xinput
    Information extracted from:
     /src_dir/qtbase/src/3rdparty/xcb/qt_attribution.json
    Entry index: 0
    Id: xcb-xinput
    Name: XCB-XInput
    Description: XInput 2 extension for XCB (The X protocol C-language Binding) library.
    Qt usage: Used in XCB platform plugin if xcb-xinput was not present on the system
 during Qt configuration or -bundled-xcb-xinput switch was used. To force using xcb-xinput from
 the system, pass -no-bundled-xcb-xinput.
    License: MIT License
    License file: LICENSE
</text>
